title: 'collectives-westend, coretime-westend, people-westend: use AutoXcmWeight for XCM weighing'
doc:
  - audience: Runtime Dev
    description: |
      The XCM weigher of the Collectives, Coretime and People Westend runtimes is now built with `AutoXcmWeight` instead of a
      hand-written `XcmWeightInfo`. The generated generic and fungible benchmark weight files are merged into a single
      `pallet_xcm_benchmarks` module. No weight value changes.

crates:
  - name: collectives-westend-runtime
    bump: patch
  - name: coretime-westend-runtime
    bump: patch
  - name: people-westend-runtime
    bump: patch
